    "title": "T-Life",
    "description": "T-Life is now the go-to app for T-Mobile. Get the latest exclusive deals from T-Mobile Tuesdays, and take advantage of all your Magenta Status benefits. You can manage your account, configure your T-Mobile Home Internet gateway, and track your SyncUP devices. And now Scam Shield is here to help ID suspicious numbers, set up blocks for unwanted callers, report scams, and more. You can also pay your bill, add a line to your account, and track orders straight from the app. If you need help with anything, customer care is available at the tap of a button. Not on the T-Mobile network? Sign up for Network Pass and try it out for three months free! Keep your number, phone, and existing carrier while you give T-Mobile\u2019s high-speed network a test drive.\r\n\r\nNetwork Pass: During congestion, customers on this plan using > 50GB/ mo. may notice reduced speeds until next bill cycle due to data prioritization. Non-T-Mobile customers only; 1 trial per user. Compatible unlocked device required; coverage not available in some areas. Some uses may require certain plan or feature; see plan for details.",
    "descriptionHTML": "T-Life is now the go-to app for T-Mobile. Get the latest exclusive deals from T-Mobile Tuesdays, and take advantage of all your Magenta Status benefits. You can manage your account, configure your T-Mobile Home Internet gateway, and track your SyncUP devices. And now Scam Shield is here to help ID suspicious numbers, set up blocks for unwanted callers, report scams, and more. You can also pay your bill, add a line to your account, and track orders straight from the app. If you need help with anything, customer care is available at the tap of a button. Not on the T-Mobile network? Sign up for Network Pass and try it out for three months free! Keep your number, phone, and existing carrier while you give T-Mobile\u2019s high-speed network a test drive.<br><br>Network Pass: During congestion, customers on this plan using &gt; 50GB/ mo. may notice reduced speeds until next bill cycle due to data prioritization. Non-T-Mobile customers only; 1 trial per user. Compatible unlocked device required; coverage not available in some areas. Some uses may require certain plan or feature; see plan for details.",
